"force_remove_source_branch":true,"prepared_at":"2025-12-24T08:44:58.811Z","allow_collaboration":true,"allow_maintainer_to_push":true,"reference":"!741","references":{"short":"!741","relative":"!741","full":"World/Phosh/phoc!741"},"web_url":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phoc/-/merge_requests/741","time_stats":{"time_estimate":0,"total_time_spent":0,"human_time_estimate":null,"human_total_time_spent":null},"squash":false,"squash_on_merge":false,"task_completion_status":{"count":0,"completed_count":0},"has_conflicts":false,"blocking_discussions_resolved":true},{"id":48931,"iid":294,"project_id":16763,"title":"phosh-private: Add set_exclusive_zone_anchor request","description":"This allows to specify which edge should the exclusive zone apply to\nfor surfaces that are anchored to opposite edges.\n\nThis is a PoC implementation of an idea meant to tackle the issue\ndescribed at https://github.com/swaywm/wlr-protocols/issues/102\n\nAlso contains a fix for a bug in exclusive zone calculation noticed while working on it.\n\n-----\nIn the future I'm going to propose a MR adding this feature to layer-shell. Meanwhile, this will allow phosh to run on unpatched wlroots (phosh#422).\n\nAn alternative approach would be to simply hardcode the anchor and apply it to surface with `phosh home` namespace, but I wanted to try this approach first since I'd like it to eventually land in layer-shell itself.","state":"opened","created_at":"2021-11-01T21:21:18.759Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T08:27:53.546Z","merged_by":null,"merge_user":null,"merged_at":null,"closed_by":null,"closed_at":null,"target_branch":"master","source_branch":"anchor","user_notes_count":11,"upvotes":0,"downvotes":0,"author":{"id":4244,"username":"dos","public_email":"","name":"Sebastian Krzyszkowiak","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/658ec29b0b7ead68f274adce3d6578c316cf828520c65aaf3d5075af65a663c6?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/dos","bot":false},"assignees":[],"assignee":null,"reviewers":[],"source_project_id":16786,"target_project_id":16763,"labels":["layer-shell"],"draft":false,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","work_in_progress":false,"milestone":null,"merge_when_pipeline_succeeds":false,"merge_status":"cannot_be_merged","detailed_merge_status":"need_rebase","merge_after":null,"sha":"7fd94788d512297fff900eadc9dc50f023fd1ab9","merge_commit_sha":null,"squash_commit_sha":null,"discussion_locked":null,"should_remove_source_branch":null,"force_remove_source_branch":true,"prepared_at":"2021-11-01T21:21:18.759Z","allow_collaboration":true,"allow_maintainer_to_push":true,"reference":"!294","references":{"short":"!294","relative":"!294","full":"World/Phosh/phoc!294"},"web_url":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phoc/-/merge_requests/294","time_stats":{"time_estimate":0,"total_time_spent":0,"human_time_estimate":null,"human_total_time_spent":null},"squash":false,"squash_on_merge":false,"task_completion_status":{"count":0,"completed_count":0},"has_conflicts":true,"blocking_discussions_resolved":true},{"id":83764,"iid":515,"project_id":16763,"title":"Draft: layer-surface: Use float coordinates for geometry","description":"Here's a very quick hack to avoid layer surfaces on drag making jumps by the outputs scale factor.\n\nBasically a PoC to show where people using HiDPI want to poke at.\n\nNote that there's still *very* a noticeable jump when the gesture gets recognized as we sync the surface's position with the touch point but as that's independent from scaling we'll fix that in a separate MR. As this visible on all scale factors it's also more important than this one.\n\nAlso animations need to use fractional coordinates as otherwise the stepping is visible when the surface folds via an animation (also independent from this one).\n\nEasy to develop further in a nested session using:\n\n```\nG_MESSAGES_DEBUG=phoc-layer-shell-effects WLR_BACKENDS=wayland  _build/src/phoc -C ./phoc.ini  -E '_build/examples/layer-shell-effects -l overlay -h 150 -a left -a top -a right -w 0 -f -100 -t 0.5 -e 50'\n```\n\nand a phoc.ini like\n\n```\n[output:WL-1]\nmode = 360x720\nscale = 4\n```\n\n(this is really just a lunch break hack, there's places where we don't need an fbox and also some places where we need to care about rounding)\n\nCloses: https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phoc/-/issues/293","state":"opened","created_at":"2023-12-11T13:09:44.044Z","updated_at":"2024-06-10T12:04:41.014Z","merged_by":null,"merge_user":null,"merged_at":null,"closed_by":null,"closed_at":null,"target_branch":"main","source_branch":"stepless-drag","user_notes_count":3,"upvotes":0,"downvotes":0,"author":{"id":1029,"username":"guidog","public_email":"","name":"Guido Günther","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2db348f1d0d0888423e5699c53ef899d81fc16e81d0aeddda0a1971ff1b2f7ec?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/guidog","bot":false},"assignees":[],"assignee":null,"reviewers":[],"source_project_id":16793,"target_project_id":16763,"labels":[],"draft":true,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","work_in_progress":true,"milestone":null,"merge_when_pipeline_succeeds":false,"merge_status":"cannot_be_merged_recheck","detailed_merge_status":"draft_status","merge_after":null,"sha":"1f524ebe2a65530f4ef6c47fc1cd9cc4d1823f57","merge_commit_sha":null,"squash_commit_sha":null,"discussion_locked":null,"should_remove_source_branch":null,"force_remove_source_branch":true,"prepared_at":"2023-12-11T13:09:48.339Z","allow_collaboration":true,"allow_maintainer_to_push":true,"reference":"!515","references":{"short":"!515","relative":"!515","full":"World/Phosh/phoc!515"},"web_url":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phoc/-/merge_requests/515","time_stats":{"time_estimate":0,"total_time_spent":0,"human_time_estimate":null,"human_total_time_spent":null},"squash":false,"squash_on_merge":false,"task_completion_status":{"count":0,"completed_count":0},"has